00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:29.800
says intelligence deputy Pan Chun Kwan called the sale a source of tension and concern for countries nearby.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:35.600
In the 12 hours to six this morning, the ministry also logged 15 Chinese military aircraft,

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:42.840
10 naval ships and seven official ships, with crossings into the northern, central, southwestern, and eastern identification zones.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:49.860
The response used patrol aircraft, navy vessels and coastal missiles. Pan would not detail the carrier's track,

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:54.640
back, and he said Beijing has run large encirclement drills every year since August 2022.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:59.360
He said the ministry will keep watching in real time, and that Beijing has used propaganda

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:04.560
to magnify what he called the cognitive effect of the drills, which he described as destabilizing.

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:09.920
China's Taiwan Affairs Office spokesman Chen Binhua said yesterday that Taiwan must bear

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:15.460
